{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPwipinawCmFmagbFRvH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Let me create a summary of the changes:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented all three features specified in BE-005:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field to `Order` and `Shipment` (positive integer, default 1)\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to `ShipmentStatus` enum\n- Implemented shipment transitions:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` - CREATED → CONFIRMED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` - CONFIRMED → DELIVERED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` - CREATED → CANCELLED\n- Added fulfilment status object with `allocated`, `delivered`, and `status` fields\n- Orders report fulfilment status: UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, or DELIVERED\n- `POST /shipments` validates that shipment quantity doesn't exceed order quantity (409 if it would)\n- `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` updates order quantity (409 if below allocated quantity)\n- `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS` filters orders by fulfilment status\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- `POST /orders` now validates that the customer exists (422 with error envelope if not)\n- `GET /customers/{customerId}` returns 404 with error envelope for unknown customers (was ResponseEntity.notFound())\n- Added `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` error code\n- Updated `OrderControllerTest` and `ShipmentControllerTest` to create customers before creating orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists**\n- All list endpoints (`GET /customers`, `GET /orders`, `GET /shipments`) support:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100) - validates range with 400 error\n  - `offset` parameter (≥0, default 0) - validates non-negative with 400 error\n  - Returns `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n  - On `GET /orders`, total count respects the `fulfilment` filter\n\n### Key Implementation Details\n- Created `OrderService` and `ShipmentService` to encapsulate business logic\n- All validation errors use consistent error envelope format\n- Repositories updated with pagination support methods\n- No new Maven dependencies added\n- All 13 existing tests pass, including updated OrderControllerTest and ShipmentControllerTest"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":69150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":897},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"024edd90-4227-4933-b6b0-302259787923","uuid":"e0be92dc-f883-458f-bde6-60bb13b3f8e9","timestamp":"2026-09-25T09:46:12.291Z","request_id":"req_011CfPwipFW66mnkoXGvTELt"}
